1. Definitions

"Framework" means all files distributed in this repository and in Frasm releases,
except the Application Templates.

"Application Templates" means the files in the "skeleton/" and "config/" directories,
and the copies of them that the Frasm installer places into a project (in particular
the "app/", "config/", "database/" and "public/css/" directories of a project).

"Your Application" means software that you create and that uses the Framework,
including your code in a project's "app/" directory.

"You" means the individual or legal entity exercising the rights under this license.


